        "Content": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Likeability.ST_Likeability",
          "Key": "NPC_08203_a_14",
          "SourceString": "空空如也的两段式阶梯，拐角处年久失修的电话亭格外显眼，野蛮生长的绿色无孔不入，电话亭上、墙壁上、阶梯的角落……",
          "LocalizedString": "An empty staircase lay completely bare, except for a decrepit phone booth in the corner. Wild, rampant greenery is seeping into every nook and cranny—over the booth, the walls, and the corners of the steps."
